OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' voice frustration at
OL,4,Anew recycling bins
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in part of North Yorkshire
OL,7,Fhave taken to social media to express
OL,8,Ffrustration at the lack of space for
OL,9,Fnew recycling bins being delivered to
OL,10,Fthousands of homes.
OL,12,FNorth Yorkshire Council is currently
OL,13,Fgiving out about 50,000 bins in
OL,14,FRichmondshire as part of work to
OL,15,Fstandardise waste collections across
OL,16,Fthe county.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
