OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' voice frustration at
OL,4,Anew recycling bins
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, concerns have been raised by
OL,7,Fsome people about where they would
OL,8,Fstore the new bins, with one person
OL,9,Fsaying on social media that "no one has
OL,10,Factually thought to ask us if we
OL,11,Factually want another two bins".
OL,13,FCouncillor Richard Foster, executive
OL,14,Fmember for waste services, responded
OL,15,Fthat feedback from residents already
OL,16,Fusing the service had been
OL,17,F"overwhelmingly positive".
